# Spec for tools/riscpkg.py: SoftMIDI.
Package: SoftMIDI
Section: Audio
Priority: Optional
Licence: Free
Maintainer: Andrew Youll <adyoull@users.noreply.github.com>
Standards-Version: 0.4.0
Environment: arm32, vfpv3
Depends: SharedUnixLibrary (>= 1.16), ARMEABISupport
Homepage: https://github.com/adyoull/riscos-softmidi
Description: General MIDI SoundFont and the *MIDIPlay player
 A General MIDI SoundFont (TimGM6mb) shared by programs built with the
 midisynth library, and *MIDIPlay to play .mid files through
 SharedSoundBuffer or DigitalRenderer. It goes into !Boot.Resources.
Build-Map: !SoftMIDI -> Resources/!SoftMIDI
Build-Notice: SoftMIDI, packaged for PackMan from the release zip on
 https://github.com/adyoull/riscos-softmidi/releases
 .
 SoftMIDI's player and library are under the MIT licence (see !Help);
 the TimGM6mb SoundFont is under the GNU GPL version 2, which follows.
Build-Copyright: !SoftMIDI/!Help
Build-Copyright: !SoftMIDI/SFLicence
